#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GaussianFit.GaussianFit:1
msgid "Classe contenant les paramètres du Gaussian Fit :"
msgstr "Class containing the Gaussian Fit settings:"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GaussianFit.GaussianFit:3
msgid "Attributs :"
msgstr "Attributes:"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GaussianFit.GaussianFit:5
msgid "**Mode** (:class:`Combo <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo>`) : Méthode d'ajustement gaussien (par défaut : `Mode X, Y`)."
msgstr "**Mode** (:class:`Combo <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo>`) : Gaussian fitting method (default: `Mode X, Y`)."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GaussianFit.GaussianFit:7
msgid "`0` : `Mode X, Y` (theta et sigma sont fixes)"
msgstr "`0`: `Mode X, Y` (theta and sigma are fixed)"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GaussianFit.GaussianFit:8
msgid "`1` : `Mode X, Y, Sigma` (theta est fixe, Sigma Non)"
msgstr "`1`: `Mode X, Y, Sigma` (theta is fixed, Sigma is not)"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GaussianFit.GaussianFit:9
msgid "`2` : `Mode X, Y, SigmaX, SigmaY` (theta n'est pas fixe, Sigma Si)"
msgstr "`2`: `Mode X, Y, SigmaX, SigmaY` (theta is not fixed, Sigma is)"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GaussianFit.GaussianFit:10
msgid "`3` : `Mode X, Y, SigmaX, SigmaY, Theta` (theta et sigma ne sont pas fixes)"
msgstr "`3`: `Mode X, Y, SigmaX, SigmaY, Theta` (theta and sigma are not fixed)"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GaussianFit.GaussianFit:12
msgid "**Sigma** (:class:`SpinFloat <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat>`) : Paramètre σ pour l'ajustement gaussien (par défaut : `1.0`)."
msgstr "**Sigma** (:class:`SpinFloat <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat>`): Setting σ for the Gaussian fit (default: `1.0`)."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GaussianFit.GaussianFit:13
msgid "**Theta** (:class:`SpinFloat <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat>`) : Paramètre θ pour l'ajustement gaussien (par défaut : `0.0`)."
msgstr "**Theta** (:class:`SpinFloat <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat>`): Setting θ for Gaussian fitting (default: `0.0`)."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GaussianFit.GaussianFit:14
msgid "**Z** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`) : Utilise le modèle d'astigmatisme pour estimer la position axiale Z."
msgstr "**Z** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`): Use the astigmatism model to estimate the Z-axis position."

